#: src/application.vala:1028
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A leftover portable folder was found next to AppManager (%s). AppManager "
"does not support portable mode for itself. The folder may contain apps "
"installed while this bug was active - move anything you need out of it (e.g. "
"AppImages under its Applications subfolder), then delete it."
